WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.933 --> 00:00:04.466
The next town is just through this forest.

2
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:08.000
- Let's hurry it up!
- Pikachu!

3
00:00:08.066 --> 00:00:10.600
Our heroes are on their way to Shalour City,

4
00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:15.500
where Gym Leader Korrina awaits Ash's third Kalos Gym battle challenge.

5
00:00:19.566 --> 00:00:23.000
- Na-na! Na-na-na!
- Hm? What's up?

6
00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:34.566
Aw!

7
00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:37.500
The Pokémon around here seem to be really good friends!

8
00:00:37.566 --> 00:00:40.800
They are. It's fascinating the way they all help each other out,

9
00:00:40.866 --> 00:00:42.500
gathering berries from the trees.

10
00:00:42.566 --> 00:00:45.566
Yeah. Let's go, so they can get on with it.

11
00:00:45.633 --> 00:00:47.433
- Right.
- Pika.

12
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.400
- Huh?

13
00:01:00.466 --> 00:01:03.933
What was that? Was that from the Pokémon we just saw?

14
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.500
Let's go check it out!

15
00:01:08.566 --> 00:01:10.466
- Pika!
- Look! There they are!

16
00:01:12.066 --> 00:01:14.200
- What could have happened?
- Pika?

17
00:01:14.266 --> 00:01:18.600
Hey, what is that?

18
00:01:18.666 --> 00:01:20.533
- Huh?

19
00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.066
That Ursaring's trying to take away all the berries

20
00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:30.833
that the three of them just gathered!

21
00:01:30.899 --> 00:01:32.766
- What an awful thing to do!
- Hm!

22
00:01:32.833 --> 00:01:35.233
- Bonnie, wait!
- What are you doing?

23
00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.733
You give those berries back to them now!

24
00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.933
- Na-na-na!
- Pika! pika!

25
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.733
- Okay, Pikachu, let's help them out!
- Pika!

26
00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:48.500
- Huh?
- Pika?

27
00:01:55.866 --> 00:01:57.933
Whoa! What is that?

28
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.866
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

29
00:02:00.933 --> 00:02:04.433
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

30
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.266
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

31
00:02:07.333 --> 00:02:10.299
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

32
00:02:10.366 --> 00:02:13.400
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

33
00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:16.566
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

34
00:02:16.633 --> 00:02:20.000
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

35
00:02:20.066 --> 00:02:22.633
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

36
00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.933
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

37
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.000
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

38
00:02:39.566 --> 00:02:43.233
- Who's that Pokémon? Let's take a look.
- Pika.

39
00:02:44.299 --> 00:02:46.833
Hawlucha, the Wrestling Pokémon.

40
00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:49.900
Possessing an artistic way of executing its moves,

41
00:02:49.966 --> 00:02:52.633
Hawlucha takes great pride in their elegance.

42
00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:55.633
But it looks different from the Pokédex.

43
00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:58.166
Hawlucha!

44
00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:07.200
Wowee! Hey, it's a leaf mask!

45
00:03:07.266 --> 00:03:10.533
- Pika!
- Yeah. What an awesome Pokémon!

46
00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.733
I wonder if Hawlucha's planning to get the berries from Ursaring

47
00:03:13.799 --> 00:03:17.533
and give them back to Patrat and the other two.

48
00:03:28.299 --> 00:03:33.233
Hawlucha!

49
00:03:33.299 --> 00:03:36.366
Aw, man!

50
00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:44.600
Lucha!

51
00:03:47.399 --> 00:03:49.666
Lucha!

52
00:03:50.866 --> 00:03:54.533
Lucha!

53
00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.133
- All right!
- An amazing Karate Chop

54
00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.166
with an equally amazing High Jump Kick!

55
00:04:02.233 --> 00:04:04.700
- Hawlucha's incredible!
- Yeah!

56
00:04:04.766 --> 00:04:08.833
- Pika!
- I can't believe how strong Hawlucha is!

57
00:04:08.899 --> 00:04:10.533
Na-na-na!

58
00:04:13.666 --> 00:04:15.799
Cha!

59
00:04:21.833 --> 00:04:24.133
Hawlucha!

60
00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:28.000
- What's going on?
- That's Hawlucha's victory pose.

61
00:04:28.066 --> 00:04:32.000
Hawlucha always does that just before launching into its finishing move.

62
00:04:32.066 --> 00:04:34.433
But if it poses like that...

63
00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.300
- Cha!
- Uh-oh.

64
00:04:43.166 --> 00:04:44.800
No! Hawlucha!

65
00:04:44.866 --> 00:04:48.066
Opponents always dodge its final move at the last second.

66
00:04:48.133 --> 00:04:51.133
Maybe it's because it shows off like that.

67
00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.066
- Na-na.
- Pika.

68
00:04:53.133 --> 00:04:56.800
Hawlucha has to pose, even if its opponent runs away.

69
00:04:56.866 --> 00:04:59.300
- That's just how it battles.
- Hm.

70
00:04:59.366 --> 00:05:02.233
What an interesting Pokémon!

71
00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.866
Hawlucha's committed to the artistry of battling!

72
00:05:04.933 --> 00:05:07.099
- Huh!
- Hey Ash, look at that!

73
00:05:07.166 --> 00:05:11.666
Hawlucha's battling efforts gave the Pokémon their berries back!

74
00:05:11.733 --> 00:05:13.766
Wait. Look over there!

75
00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.066
-No!

76
00:05:23.133 --> 00:05:26.666
Why you... Hey! That's enough, Ursaring. Stop it!

77
00:05:28.933 --> 00:05:31.500
Ah! Quick, Pikachu, use Iron Tail!

78
00:05:31.566 --> 00:05:37.099
Pikachu!

79
00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:48.066
- All right!
- Wow.

80
00:05:51.599 --> 00:05:54.166
Don't be so mean from now on!

81
00:05:54.233 --> 00:05:56.300
Are you okay?

82
00:05:59.466 --> 00:06:01.466
Lucha.

83
00:06:01.533 --> 00:06:04.800
You know, I like your awesome attitude about battling.

84
00:06:04.866 --> 00:06:06.233
Cha.

85
00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:09.533
- Ash, are you okay?
- Uh-huh.

86
00:06:09.599 --> 00:06:13.233
- You had me worried there for a minute!
- Yeah, me, too!

87
00:06:18.299 --> 00:06:20.833
Huh?

88
00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.866
Hawlucha's so cool.

89
00:06:29.933 --> 00:06:32.233
So you like Hawlucha, eh?

90
00:06:32.299 --> 00:06:34.833
Do you know a lot of stuff about Hawlucha?

91
00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:38.266
Yes. I've been caretaker of this forest for a long time,

92
00:06:38.333 --> 00:06:40.200
so I know Hawlucha quite well.

93
00:06:40.266 --> 00:06:43.400
It would be so great if you'd tell me everything about it.

94
00:06:43.466 --> 00:06:46.000
- Would you?
- I'd be happy to.

95
00:06:51.099 --> 00:06:55.033
First off, the name's Keaton. It's a pleasure to meet you.

96
00:06:55.099 --> 00:06:57.099
It's a pleasure to meet you, too!

97
00:06:57.166 --> 00:07:00.333
My name's Ash and this is my partner Pikachu.

98
00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.466
- Pikachu!
- My name's Clemont.

99
00:07:02.533 --> 00:07:04.933
And I'm Bonnie. It's nice to meet you.

100
00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.466
- This is Dedenne!
- Na-na-na.

101
00:07:07.533 --> 00:07:11.099
- My name's Serena.
- The pleasure's all mine.

102
00:07:11.166 --> 00:07:13.733
- So...
- Huh?

103
00:07:13.799 --> 00:07:16.466
Right. You want to know about Hawlucha.

104
00:07:17.799 --> 00:07:20.966
One day, it simply wandered into the forest.

105
00:07:21.033 --> 00:07:23.733
There are lots of proud Fighting types living here,

106
00:07:23.799 --> 00:07:25.966
so I'm pretty sure Hawlucha wanted to see

107
00:07:26.033 --> 00:07:28.633
how it stacked up against them in battle.

108
00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:33.433
One after another, Hawlucha defeated the strongest Pokémon in the forest,

109
00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:35.966
earning the nickname Forest Champion.

110
00:07:36.033 --> 00:07:37.933
Forest Champion, huh?

111
00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.166
Hawlucha defends the gentler Pokémon

112
00:07:40.233 --> 00:07:44.333
against the more aggressive ones, which ends up being a big help to me.

113
00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:48.433
- Just like what we witnessed before!
- But today, Hawlucha lost.

114
00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.633
- Na-na-na.
- Its attacks take too much time.

115
00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:55.200
Hawlucha would have beaten Ursaring if only it hadn't posed.

116
00:07:55.266 --> 00:07:58.500
Hawlucha has a special sense of battle artistry.

117
00:07:58.566 --> 00:08:02.766
Even if it means defeat, it's simply something Hawlucha has to do.

118
00:08:02.833 --> 00:08:06.333
I get it! Hawlucha's really dedicated to its battle style.

119
00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:09.533
Agreed. If you're interested, I'd be more than happy

120
00:08:09.599 --> 00:08:13.500
to show you the place where Hawlucha does all of its special training.

121
00:08:13.566 --> 00:08:16.733
Yeah? You'd really do that? That'd be great!

122
00:08:23.599 --> 00:08:26.033
Keldurr.

123
00:08:35.533 --> 00:08:36.866
Champ?

124
00:08:42.633 --> 00:08:45.766
Con! Con! Keldurr! Con! Con! Conkeldurr!

125
00:08:45.833 --> 00:08:52.000
Champ?! Champ!

126
00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:01.600
Its special training area is near the waterfall up ahead.

127
00:09:01.666 --> 00:09:04.500
Hawlucha's always practicing Flying Press.

128
00:09:07.066 --> 00:09:08.866
Huh! Up there!

129
00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:12.233
- Yes!
- Ash, hold on!

130
00:09:22.266 --> 00:09:25.699
Huh?

131
00:09:30.766 --> 00:09:32.666
My name's Ash.

132
00:09:32.733 --> 00:09:35.666
I'd like you to try your Flying Press out on me.

133
00:09:35.733 --> 00:09:39.199
- Hawlucha?
- Huh? Oh.

134
00:09:39.266 --> 00:09:41.699
You don't have to worry about me.

135
00:09:41.766 --> 00:09:43.766
See, it would be really awesome

136
00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:46.833
if you'd let me help you perfect that move!

137
00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:50.866
Lucha?

138
00:09:54.033 --> 00:09:55.866
Cha.

139
00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:59.366
All right. Bring it on!

140
00:09:59.433 --> 00:10:01.366
Lucha!

141
00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:09.166
Too slow. Do that and I'll dodge it just like Ursaring did.

142
00:10:09.233 --> 00:10:14.033
- You've got to move faster!
- Lu.

143
00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.533
Still too slow!

144
00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:24.900
- How many times is that?
- I... I don't know.

145
00:10:24.966 --> 00:10:29.366
But I think it's more times than I can count on both of my hands.

146
00:10:29.433 --> 00:10:33.633
Of course. When Hawlucha poses like it does, it's easy to dodge.

147
00:10:33.699 --> 00:10:36.900
If only we could speed up its Flying Press,

148
00:10:36.966 --> 00:10:40.166
without giving up on Hawlucha's battle style.

149
00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:56.300
-Huh?

150
00:10:56.366 --> 00:10:58.266
Cha!

151
00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:02.566
-Ohm no! Ash!

152
00:11:02.633 --> 00:11:05.833
- You got hit hard!
- Hey! Are you all right?

153
00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:09.566
Yeah! I think I figured out a way to keep your battling style

154
00:11:09.633 --> 00:11:13.733
and at the same time stop your rivals from being able to dodge it!

155
00:11:14.766 --> 00:11:16.733
Huh?

156
00:11:18.033 --> 00:11:19.466
Hm.

157
00:11:19.533 --> 00:11:22.533
- Do you think you can do it?
- Cha.

158
00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:24.699
- Something's coming.
- Huh?

159
00:11:24.766 --> 00:11:26.533
- Huh?
- Chalu.

160
00:11:30.033 --> 00:11:33.533
Ursaring. And it's with Conkeldurr!

161
00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:37.333
They're the ones that prey on weaker forest Pokémon, right?

162
00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:40.233
The forest bullies.

163
00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.666
Uh. With the leader of the outfit.

164
00:11:48.233 --> 00:11:52.000
- Machamp.
- Machamp!

165
00:11:52.066 --> 00:11:54.533
Who's that Pokémon?

166
00:11:59.066 --> 00:12:01.433
It's Hawlucha!

167
00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:10.300
Champ!

168
00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:16.633
- Hacha.
- So, it's Machamp.

169
00:12:16.699 --> 00:12:20.566
- It's been a long time.
- Do you know that Machamp?

170
00:12:20.633 --> 00:12:27.433
Yes. The truth is that Machamp actually used to be the Forest Champion,

171
00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:30.533
helping keep things calm and peaceful,

172
00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:34.699
but when Hawlucha arrived, the two of them became rivals.

173
00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:40.000
Over the course of time, Machamp began to lose more and more battles.

174
00:12:40.066 --> 00:12:43.733
Finally, having been forced to hand the title of Forest Champion

175
00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:47.233
over to Hawlucha, Machamp disappeared.

176
00:12:49.333 --> 00:12:51.066
I've heard several rumors

177
00:12:51.133 --> 00:12:55.233
that Machamp had been living up in the mountains, training hard.

178
00:12:55.300 --> 00:13:00.300
I wonder if it's come back with Ursaring and Conkeldurr to settle the score.

179
00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.000
Cha. Cha.

180
00:13:05.066 --> 00:13:07.699
- Champ.
- Huh?

181
00:13:07.766 --> 00:13:10.533
So Machamp wants a one-on-one battle with Hawlucha.

182
00:13:10.599 --> 00:13:17.300
Machamp!

183
00:13:21.099 --> 00:13:25.033
Machamp must be challenging Hawlucha for Forest Champion!

184
00:13:25.099 --> 00:13:27.099
-It's hard to say.

185
00:13:27.166 --> 00:13:30.533
I guess the answer is hidden in the outcome of this battle.

186
00:13:45.633 --> 00:13:50.199
Wow. It's just standing there!

187
00:13:56.833 --> 00:13:59.300
Machamp isn't countering at all! Why?

188
00:13:59.366 --> 00:14:04.133
I'm pretty sure it's gauging just how firm Hawlucha's resolve is.

189
00:14:04.199 --> 00:14:06.966
Ah. So they're sizing each other up!

190
00:14:07.033 --> 00:14:09.133
That's right.

191
00:14:17.599 --> 00:14:19.699
- Oh! Oh, no!

192
00:14:19.766 --> 00:14:21.900
- What's that all about?
- Pika!

193
00:14:21.966 --> 00:14:24.166
Battling three against one isn't fair!

194
00:14:24.233 --> 00:14:25.666
Champ?

195
00:14:25.733 --> 00:14:30.133
Wait. It looks like Machamp is as surprised as you are.

196
00:14:30.199 --> 00:14:33.166
I think the other two were planning this from the very beginning.

197
00:14:35.333 --> 00:14:37.033
- Oh no!
- Pika!

198
00:14:42.633 --> 00:14:45.833
Champ. Champ!

199
00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:52.433
Champ!

200
00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:59.933
- Con! Con! Conkeldurr!

201
00:15:00.066 --> 00:15:02.733
Champ! Champ! Machamp!

202
00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:04.733
-Hawlucha!

203
00:15:07.566 --> 00:15:09.500
Machamp!

204
00:15:09.566 --> 00:15:12.000
- Whoa!
- Pika!

205
00:15:14.566 --> 00:15:16.433
Champ.

206
00:15:21.133 --> 00:15:23.500
Champ?

207
00:15:23.566 --> 00:15:26.000
Huh! Machamp stopped it!

208
00:15:32.166 --> 00:15:34.533
Ma.

209
00:15:35.533 --> 00:15:37.533
Lucha.

210
00:15:37.599 --> 00:15:39.033
Champ.

211
00:15:42.533 --> 00:15:47.599
It seems Machamp and Hawlucha have agreed to battle at another time.

212
00:15:48.599 --> 00:15:52.933
What do you know. Machamp was really cool about the whole thing.

213
00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:55.699
Awesome! That's the way it should be.

214
00:15:57.466 --> 00:15:59.133
Hmm.

215
00:15:59.199 --> 00:16:03.300
Hawlucha! That's too bad about your battle with Machamp.

216
00:16:03.366 --> 00:16:06.966
But if you still want to have a heated battle, let me take its place!

217
00:16:07.033 --> 00:16:08.466
Hawlucha?

218
00:16:08.533 --> 00:16:11.800
I told you I think you're an awesome Pokémon.

219
00:16:11.866 --> 00:16:16.566
I'll tell you the truth. I'd like you to come along with me!

220
00:16:16.633 --> 00:16:19.833
Ha. Chalu!

221
00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:22.900
- All right!
- Wow, Ash, that's so cool!

222
00:16:28.433 --> 00:16:30.266
Cha.

223
00:16:31.766 --> 00:16:34.199
- Pika?
- Wait a minute, buddy.

224
00:16:34.266 --> 00:16:35.699
Pi? Pika?

225
00:16:35.766 --> 00:16:40.699
There's someone else I'd like to try out against Hawlucha's fierce battling style!

226
00:16:45.699 --> 00:16:47.866
Froakie!

227
00:16:47.933 --> 00:16:49.466
Ha!

228
00:16:49.533 --> 00:16:53.300
Okay, Froakie! Give it all you've got! Water Pulse!

229
00:16:55.599 --> 00:16:57.333
-Fro!

230
00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:01.199
Kie!

231
00:17:01.266 --> 00:17:03.733
- Froakie, Double Team!

232
00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:05.933
- Fro!
- Kie!

233
00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.533
Huh?

234
00:17:09.933 --> 00:17:14.966
- Now use Bubble!
- Bubble!

235
00:17:15.033 --> 00:17:17.700
- Huh?
- All right, Froakie!

236
00:17:17.766 --> 00:17:21.399
I want you to jump up off and grab Hawlucha. Go!

237
00:17:21.466 --> 00:17:23.533
Kie!

238
00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:26.633
Froakie!

239
00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:29.966
That's what I call incredible jumping power and speed!

240
00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:35.600
Huh? Now, Froakie, Double Team!

241
00:17:35.666 --> 00:17:37.033
Cha.

242
00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:42.600
- Fro!
- Froakie, use Pound!

243
00:17:50.966 --> 00:17:53.399
So fast!

244
00:17:58.166 --> 00:18:01.766
Yeah! I think I've figured out a way to keep your battling style

245
00:18:01.833 --> 00:18:05.200
and at the same time, stop your rivals from being able to dodge it!

246
00:18:05.266 --> 00:18:07.266
You just jump up high in the air

247
00:18:07.333 --> 00:18:10.200
and then you do that pose with your arms wide open!

248
00:18:10.266 --> 00:18:12.566
After that, do a quick spin,

249
00:18:12.633 --> 00:18:16.366
aim for your opponent's chest and come down fast!

250
00:18:17.366 --> 00:18:20.533
Well, Hawlucha? Will you give it a try?

251
00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:24.399
Here it comes. Hawlucha's Flying Press for the final move!

252
00:18:24.466 --> 00:18:28.433
Haw! Cha!

253
00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.833
- Oh! Check it out!
- That's fast!

254
00:18:31.899 --> 00:18:33.600
- It's working!
- Huh?

255
00:18:33.666 --> 00:18:36.066
Quick, Froakie, use Pound!

256
00:18:36.133 --> 00:18:38.833
Fro!

257
00:18:48.066 --> 00:18:50.600
Ash, are you all right?

258
00:18:52.733 --> 00:18:54.600
Hold on. What happened?

259
00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:01.266
So how are we going to figure out who won?

260
00:19:01.333 --> 00:19:04.899
Huh. I'd have to say that they knocked each other out.

261
00:19:04.966 --> 00:19:07.200
And that sounds like a draw to me.

262
00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:21.000
Hawlucha, thanks! Having a battle with you was great.

263
00:19:21.066 --> 00:19:23.733
I think you're a really special Pokémon.

264
00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:29.000
Getting your Flying Press perfect like that during a real battle was amazing!

265
00:19:29.066 --> 00:19:33.166
It may have looked like a draw, but the truth is I totally lost.

266
00:19:33.233 --> 00:19:36.366
I know you're going to be fine from here on out!

267
00:19:36.433 --> 00:19:39.300
You know what? I think you want to go with Ash.

268
00:19:39.366 --> 00:19:41.666
- Cha.
- Machamp!

269
00:19:41.733 --> 00:19:43.833
- Huh?
- Huh?

270
00:19:46.366 --> 00:19:47.899
Hm.

271
00:19:47.966 --> 00:19:51.000
Now, don't worry. The forest will be fine.

272
00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:57.399
- Cha.
- So, Hawlucha, want to come along?

273
00:19:57.466 --> 00:19:59.766
- Hawcha.
- Great!

274
00:19:59.833 --> 00:20:03.200
We're going to be really good friends, I promise!

275
00:20:13.333 --> 00:20:19.133
Yes! I caught Hawlucha. Yeah!

276
00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:21.000
- Pika! Pika!
- Froak!

277
00:20:21.066 --> 00:20:23.233
- Ash?

278
00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:24.466
Huh?

279
00:20:24.533 --> 00:20:27.333
I trust that you'll take good care of Hawlucha.

280
00:20:27.399 --> 00:20:31.066
Please make sure you give it lots of action-packed battles!

281
00:20:31.133 --> 00:20:32.000
Right!

282
00:20:32.066 --> 00:20:36.166
And so, Ash has a new Pokémon friend in Hawlucha,

283
00:20:36.233 --> 00:20:38.266
with its strong battle style.

284
00:20:38.333 --> 00:20:41.800
Now, our hero's Shalour City Gym battle challenge awaits,

285
00:20:41.866 --> 00:20:44.566
as the journey continues!
